### Crywolf::ScheduleSettings::Schedule ###
	Up to 20 rows (MAX_CRYWOLF_STATE_TIME) scheduling when the
	event starts:
	Mode              Schedule mode (0 = normal).
	State             State to enter when triggered.
	Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute  Real-world clock match;
	                  -1 = any/wildcard for that field.
	ContinuanceTime   -1 = use the matching <StateTime>'s
	                  duration instead.

### Crywolf::StateTimeSettings::StateTime ###
	One row per state (1-7, MAX_CRYWOLF_STATE):
	State    State number (matches eCrywolfState-style state ids).
	Hour/Minute/Second  How long that state lasts.

### Crywolf::MonsterGroupSettings::MonsterGroup ###
	Up to 20 (MAX_CRYWOLF_MONSTER_GROUP) AI group numbers active
	during the event, one per row: Value

### Crywolf::Boss ###
	Group/TurnUpTime - which AI group is the boss group, and how
	many seconds until it appears.

### Crywolf::AIChange ###
	Time - seconds between monster AI behavior changes.

### Crywolf::MVPScore ###
	Table1-7 - score awarded per MVP scoring category.

### Crywolf::MVPRankScore ###
	Table1-5 - minimum score thresholds for MVP ranks 1-5.

### Crywolf::MVPRankExp ###
	Table1-5 - experience reward for each MVP rank.

### Crywolf::MVPRankRewardSettings::MVPRankReward ###
	Rank 0-4 (matches the MVPRankScore/MVPRankExp tiers, in the same
	order as Table1-5) - WC/WP/GP (WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint) and
	GensContribution (Gens Family contribution points), paid to every
	player on the Crywolf map at the end of the event, based on their
	personal MVP rank. GensContribution=0 means none.

### Crywolf::Benefit ###
	Applied server-wide (outside the Crywolf map while it's actively
	running) after a WIN (guardians successfully defended the statue /
	killed Balgass):
	Enable            0/1.
	PlusChaosRate     Bonus added to the Chaos Machine combine success
	                  rate, percentage points.
	MonsterHPRate     Resulting HP percentage for regular monsters
	                  (e.g. 80 = monsters spawn at 80% HP, a 20% cut).

### Crywolf::Penalty ###
	Applied server-wide after a LOSS (statue destroyed / Balgass not
	killed in time):
	Enable                  0/1.
	GemDropPenaltyRate      Chance (1-100) that a jewel drop (Bless/
	                        Soul/Life/Creation/Guardian/Harmony) is
	                        allowed to proceed - the remainder is
	                        discarded. E.g. 70 = 30% of jewel drops get
	                        blocked.
	GettingExpPenaltyRate   Experience multiplier, percentage (100 =
	                        no penalty, 70 = -30% experience).

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

